{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b4d77d8cb70c1446f64792a07bf7709c6e281a41945d264ab3a291ca986f8cab", "ja": "昨日はライブお疲れさま、亜利沙！\nファンのみんなも、楽しんでくれたみたいだ。", "zh": "亚利沙，昨天演唱会辛苦了！\n粉丝好像也都很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "70852e60411ad05517c0c0065508690dfdb1d20862a821e61b467b8f5ac07ad7", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまです！\nえへへ、本当ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你也辛苦了！\n嘿嘿，真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1002_p", "source_sha256": "65983122e854614ed20a7a8c77307a4478787383640ed5ceb1420313856acf67", "ja": "ああ、ファンの人達の感想を見たけど、\nみんな亜利沙の事、すごく可愛かったって言ってたよ。", "zh": "嗯，我看了很多粉丝的感想，\n大家都说亚利沙超可爱的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "e7f75890b501a453ca6ef8f879d6230a3390dc25c02e3f56574120df859dcfcd", "ja": "えへ、えへへ……カワイイだなんて、そんな……♪\nなんだか照れちゃいますね……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，嘿嘿……居然说亚利沙可爱，这么夸张……♪\n总觉得有点不好意思呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "f4f23a01703adf16b5f981f707e68e434d73b64ce25eb7a5736b830f38b90072", "ja": "ありさは、ファンのみんながよろこんでくれるのが\n一番うれしいです！　あっ、それに今回は……。", "zh": "能看到各位粉丝开心，才是最让亚利沙开心的事！\n啊，而且这次……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "6a4c6a6c88d812f59cc629c211488e26943f32737ba441a9f06ca91dbb7a8743", "ja": "なんといっても、ライブ後のスパというごほうびが\nありましたから！　ありさ、とっても頑張れました♪", "zh": "最重要的是有演唱会后的SPA这个奖励啊！\n这让亚利沙超级有动力去努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "07eec0311aaa2c5b0b02d48cc02de2f634c84b1935b9cfa80e2fbd31662b3f71", "ja": "カワイイアイドルちゃんたちのみじゅぎ姿、\n最高でしたよぉ～！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "可爱的偶像宝贝们穿泳衣的样子，\n真是太棒了～！……唔呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f936eaca0320702df18938da0fbb778a4742853848aa5dce9e46d0f51ea28dcf", "ja": "そ、そうか……亜利沙もアイドルなんだけどな。\nところで、筋肉痛はもう大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "是、是吗……但亚利沙你也是偶像啊。\n话说，你的肌肉酸痛已经好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "1677bdb8d4a6c2ff4fff1792be0c189baa493128408e53c13b79fbf59ab497ed", "ja": "はい♪　{$P$}さんのおかげで……\nあ、ダメです！　その話はやめてください！", "zh": "对啊♪这都要感谢{$P$}先生……\n啊，不行！别提起那个话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "85d233bdd121d73bd9152d398a641f0c7f95321cde5c22008d198061415264b4", "ja": "え？　急にどうしたんだ。", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "5a93949838a89eb845ea03c668b1e7606afc382b06b7be1bac1b6d15841b7fae", "ja": "だって、だって！　{$P$}さんが、\nありさを、ま、マッサージとか、思い出したら……。", "zh": "因为、因为！会想起{$P$}先生\n帮亚利沙按、按摩啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1011_p", "source_sha256": "137f50f8cd8fdd1b0c57b455598eef756bb87a3d1d410777628626e449850943", "ja": "ああ、手も足もだいぶ凝ってたな。\nまだ痛むなら、続きを……。", "zh": "哦哦，记得那时你手脚都很僵硬啊。\n要是还会痛的话，我可以继续……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "755c74812ddd98fb2741ddb8b85f2c82df3c4da6d425424d8040379e30e0d291", "ja": "やぁ～んっ！？　そ、そんなのダメですよぉ～！", "zh": "讨厌～！不、不可以这样啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0063_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "4543af0c79385860abaebec119609900ef747b253ed95064596bfdfd22532be8", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　ありさの\n筋肉痛のコトは、今すぐ忘れちゃってくださいね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n亚利沙肌肉酸痛这件事，请你现在立刻忘掉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
